WEBVTT

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.820
Welcome! The next stage of the
Beyblade world championships is...

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:46.420
Egypt!

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:49.700
The world championships
enter the second half!

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.700
Let's take a moment to
review the current scores!

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:59.740
It's a tight race! And as you can see,
each team has won at least once!

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:04.060
Every team has a chance
to make it to the finals!

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:09.500
Lose a third time and your
path to the finals is gone!

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.020
Teams with two losses
have their backs to the wall!

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:17.650
But teams with two wins can
make it straight to the finals!

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:22.370
We're about to Go, Shoot to the
all-important Egyptian stage!

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:37.210
We will soon be
landing in Cairo, Egypt.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.480
We finally landed!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.280
I've always
wanted to see Egypt!

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:55.340
The incredibly
beautiful Cleopatra...

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:57.900
And the pyramids!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:01.170
It's the most romantic
of ancient cultures!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.520
Clay-on-mattress
and myrapids?

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.300
No! Cleopatra and pyrami--

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.640
It's a mummy!!

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:20.860
No, it's just Daichi.
He doesn't fly very well.

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.610
What a handful.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.370
Mihael!

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:40.200
Thank you, thank you.
Excuse us.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.700
He sure is
popular here too.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.700
None of them know the truth.
I hope they aren't up to anything dirty.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:55.560
I'm sure you know better now.
Don't you Mihael?

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:59.490
I trust your
passionate Beyspirits!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:06.410
Kids. Do you know
who got you this far?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.940
You know, don't you?

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.100
--It was you, Coach Barthez.
--It was you, Coach Barthez.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:20.280
We will do what it takes to win.
So what the hell happened in Spain?

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:24.460
So now, we have to
win our next match at all costs!

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:27.840
Claude and Aaron, you two
will fight Neo-Borg tomorrow!

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:34.360
Anyone who disobeys my orders has no place in this tournament!

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:36.130
Am I wrong?

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:42.730
I must now attend
an official reception.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:47.570
Do your usual practice drills.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.610
Got it?

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.940
Mihael, are you
okay with this?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.820
What were we even--

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:03.880
It's okay.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.200
But Mihael...

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.570
It's okay!

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:10.080
I don't regret what I did.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:13.970
Even if I can't play in the
tournament anymore, I...

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:15.500
I...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.660
I learned something
more valuable than winning.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:25.810
In that short battle, I gained a sense
of fulfillment I've never had before!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:31.500
And that's all I need!

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:33.560
--Mihael...

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:48.450
Wow! Egyptian clothing
is so beautiful!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.640
And look at all
the exotic food!

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:55.870
I'll take this!
And this! And this!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.400
We've got a match
to prepare for.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.340
Is this really the time
to be hanging out?

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.760
Are you scared?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.640
Not really, but...

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:11.050
Then don't worry! We might as well
enjoy ourselves. We're in Egypt after all.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:16.010
The next match'll be a piece of cake
if we request another four-man battle.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.240
Thanks for your purchase, sir!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:19.770
Yeah...

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:27.250
Look at all the people!
Check that out, Daichi!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:31.360
I finally feel alive again...

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:36.060
I guess with a name like Daichi, you really are most comfortable on the ground.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:41.050
I thought Egypt was just a bunch
of sand, but I guess I was wrong.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.490
Well, it is one stop on
the world championships!

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:48.100
The number of Beybladers here
has increased considerably!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.810
Really...

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.970
Speak of the devil. Look.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.240
Look at 'em go!

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:06.520
Go!

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:07.980
I won't lose!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:12.920
I did it!

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:14.420
He got me!

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:16.460
Must be nice!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:17.830
Yeah!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.680
It's my turn!

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.480
Daichi...

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:42.810
Daichi, would you
do me a favor?

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:47.020
Would you like to do a test
battle with this Beyblade?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.040
No way! Is this...

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:55.580
I used Gaia Dragoon as
a base to make this.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:59.690
It's a masterwork I created by
using all of my best techniques!

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:02.160
Gaia Dragoon...

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.200
But!

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:11.020
I can't! The Gaia Dragoon my dad gave me is supposed to be the only one in the world!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:15.660
Can't you see
how Kyoujyu feels?

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.450
Kyoujyu...

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.400
He prioritized finishing this Bey before repairing his Einstein!

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:25.020
He made this
Bey just for you!

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:33.660
I know how it feels to
lose your beloved Bey, but...

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.800
Is it really okay to stay this way?

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:40.010
Gaia Dragoon would be
sad to see you like this.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:44.620
You should move forward! You can't become world champion on nostalgia alone.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.400
Move forward...

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.380
Oh well!
But just one battle!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.240
"Oh well"?!

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:58.000
I'm up next!
Someone battle me!

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.800
All right.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.900
Here I come!
Go, Shoot!

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.730
Go, Daichi!

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:13.730
You can do it!

00:09:14.690 --> 00:09:20.290
This really feels like I'm
fighting with Gaia Dragoon.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:22.680
And if it is...

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:27.500
Go! Burst Hurricane!

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.070
Daichi...

00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:59.840
I made up my mind!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:03.260
Kyoujyu!
This thing's unreal!

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:06.180
From now on,
this is my Gaia Dragoon!

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.770
No, my new partner!

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:11.290
Gaia Dragoon Great!

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:17.090
Wow! I've never seen a Bey so strong and cool before!

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:23.800
Hey, lay off! Back up!

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:24.740
I'm glad!

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:27.090
Daichi's looking happy!

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:33.400
I can't hold back! Let me in!

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:37.060
Mine's cool too!
It's called Dragoon Galaxy!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.530
--He never changes.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:40.940
He never does.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:50.920
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:59.400
Blade Base, okay. Weight Disk, okay. Attack Ring, okay.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.020
All good to go?

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:04.330
Sure are.
They're regulation-approved.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:06.560
Good luck.

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:10.300
Thank you. Excuse us.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.260
It's so damn hot.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:27.890
Welcome to the start of the Egyptian
stage of the world championships!

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:35.130
The first match is between Neo-Borg with two
wins, and the ever popular Barthez Soldat!

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:45.020
The stands are filled with friends and rivals coming to check out the match!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:54.380
Kai's team VS Mihael's team!
This'll be awesome.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:58.460
A pre-battle Bey check is such a
ridiculous formality. Don't you agree?

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.720
--Yes, Coach Barthez.

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:05.730
It's so easy to just swap
them out afterwards.

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:09.570
You will use these
Beys for your match.

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:12.920
This is Mission S.
The spider strategy!

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:18.010
With one press of a button
it'll release a sticky thread.

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:24.060
This thread will cling to the opponent
and stop them. Just like a spiderweb!

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:27.650
All you need
to do is shoot.

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:30.360
I'll handle the rest!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.520
You're in the
first battle, Aaron!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.190
Yes, Coach Barthez!

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:41.770
Just get on with it.
I can't stand this heat.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.200
Hurry up, Aaron!

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:54.850
The first battle will be
between Yuriy and Aaron!

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:59.610
What? Aaron?
What about Mihael?

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:04.120
Claude's in the second battle?
Mihael got benched?

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:05.490
No way!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.280
Damn him!

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.800
The stadium for
this match will be...

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.480
The Sphinx Stadium!

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:25.420
With Aaron's debut and
Yuriy on a losing streak...

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:28.280
What kind of match
will they fight?

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.930
Three! Two! One!

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.640
--Go, Shoot!

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:43.680
I can't afford to make
any further blunders!

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:47.960
Attack all you like.

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:53.090
But little do you know that each attack
draws you closer to your inevitable demise!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:06.340
He's planning something.
So before he gets the chance...

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:09.500
Go, Aaron. Mission S!

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:21.400
That's perfect.
Stay right on him!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.940
Take this!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.520
What happened?
Blasted thing!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.250
No!

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.520
I don't regret what I did.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.560
Which is why...

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.890
I don't...
I don't want to...

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.960
You fool! Take this!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:52.840
Novae Rog!

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:33.400
Aaron, Stadium Out!

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:36.300
The Russian wolf
bares its fangs!

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:39.400
Yuriy takes the win!

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:46.980
What's the meaning
of this, Aaron?

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:49.740
Why didn't you
use my Bey?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:54.200
You know what happens when you disobey me, don't you?

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.460
Yes, Coach Barthez.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:59.820
But I don't
regret what I did!

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:03.210
Aaron!

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:05.720
You useless little...

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.740
You know what to do!

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:08.810
Yes, sir!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:12.090
I...

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:19.450
But our ace is Mihael!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.360
What?!

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:24.440
Go, Mihael. You really
want to fight, don't you?

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:30.600
You should go. And show
him how we really battle!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.010
Claude...

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.280
You guys!

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:43.000
Enough of your selfish
prattling. You are warriors.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:47.240
Warriors of Barthez!
Barthez Soldat!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:52.160
Do you have any idea
what you're doing?!

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.740
We aren't your
puppets anymore!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:57.810
We're Bladers, and we
fight with our own will!

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.490
Why you!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:04.210
Hit me if you want! In front of the thousands
of people watching in the stands!

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:08.760
The second battle is next, but...

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.530
What?

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.580
Is everything okay, I wonder?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.250
If that's what
you want, fine.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:21.970
You can't win without me.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.240
I've had enough of
your insubordination!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:33.800
Whoa, a change of players? The ace
Mihael comes from the Barthez bench!

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:37.980
Mihael! There he is!
I knew he'd come!

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:40.330
You can do it, Mihael!

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:49.330
Will this be the
end of the match?

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.140
Three! Two! One!

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:53.930
Go, Shoot!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:18:00.920
Go, Death Gargoyle!
There's nothing left to drag you down!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:05.960
Is he going for the demon's
howl right off the bat?

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:09.640
No, the sparkle from
the sunlight's reflection...

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.700
The tone of it rushing
through the wind!

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:15.530
Death Gargoyle is so
blindingly beautiful today!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:19.160
Here I come, Kai Hiwatari!

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:22.090
Go, Dranzer!

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:35.360
Let's do it! This is the
power of Barthez Soldat!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:39.220
Fire Execution!

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:53.360
We're not done yet.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.370
What?

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:59.440
Did you think your flames would be enough to beat Dranzer?

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:03.930
Let me show you what
real flames are made of!

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:13.970
Blazing Gig!

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:29.060
But Kai remains victorious!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:33.930
What strength!
He's strong! Far too strong!

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:40.400
Kai brings Neo-Borg
to three wins!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:43.010
They've made
it to the finals!

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:45.010
That was a nice attack.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:51.850
This is ludicrous!
I was obviously right!

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:56.440
I guess I lost.
I've got a long way to go.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:05.860
--Mihael! Mihael!

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:07.050
What?!

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:13.700
The crowd is cheering for Mihael
for fighting an uphill battle!

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:17.280
Barthez Soldat has touched
our hearts despite their loss!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:21.330
Thank you for such a
wonderful match, Mihael!

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:24.020
This is impossible!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:32.100
--Mihael! Mihael!

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.280
That was a great battle.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:37.490
Mihael was so cool!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:42.510
He's just the kind of
guy I thought he was.

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:47.760
Fighting fairly is
never a bad thing.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:51.120
Fighting with all my
strength is what I do best!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:54.690
That isn't an
insult to the sport!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.720
What a load.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:01.940
I hope I can get you to
understand that one day.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.040
Mihael...

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:04.600
--Mihael...

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:07.700
You guys...

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.770
I'm sorry. I lost.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.520
That's okay!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:15.610
Yeah.
We have nothing to regret!

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:20.140
After all, we just got
our first real cheers!

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:24.360
Claude...
Matilda... Aaron!

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:29.250
Let's go! To the real
battles waiting for us!

00:22:57.290 --> 00:23:01.100
What? Max and Rick are gonna
fight in a four-man battle?

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:06.120
Against Rei and Rai at that!
What's gotten into you, Max?

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:10.770
We can't win if our
hearts are out of sync!

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:13.480
I have to do this so Rick and I
can understand each other!

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:16.220
But Rick...
You wouldn't!

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:17.740
NOOOO!!

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:20.900
Darn it, you stubborn bull!
